  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/319/ex_machinis_sf.png\" alt=\"Ex Machinis\" width=\"1416\" height=\"788\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>《Ex Deorum》的自動化模組外掛。新增了以 RF 供電的篩子、鎚子與壓縮機。此為《Ex Machinis》的移植版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組不提供發電功能，您需要額外安裝其他模組來提供能源，例如&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Expansion</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/powah-rearchitected\" rel=\"nofollow\">Powah! Rearchitected</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>照片中的模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblefordays\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleForDays</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pipez</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Expansion</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>重點模組：</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cPikjwQnKpE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
